<title>ICELAND: SOCCER-KR REYKJAVIK WIN UEFA CUP PRELIMINARY ROUND TIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KR REYKJAVIK WIN UEFA CUP PRELIMINARY ROUND TIE.</headline>
<dateline>REYKJAVIK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a UEFA Cup first</p>
<p>preliminary round, first leg match played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>KR Reykjavik (Iceland) 2 Dinamo Bucharest (Romania) 0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Einar Thor Danielsson 27 pen, Rikardur Dadason 51.</p>
<p>Second leg in Bucharest on July 30.</p>
</text>
